The action registration occurs in the `LikeButtonContainer` class in `client/blocks/like-button/index.jsx`. The `handleLikeToggle` method (lines 32-44) checks login state and dispatches the pending action when the user is not logged in.

Running a verification script to test the reducer behavior dynamically confirms how the pending action is stored and then lost:

```bash
cat > /tmp/test_reducer.js << 'EOF'
